(Bug #15 regression: a `value` holding text reassigned to an integer must move the tag to integer. This direction already worked because a text initializer never clobbered the static type, but it is locked in so a future static-type clobber cannot silently regress it.)

a value called v is "text".
Set v to 7.
Print v.
If v is a number, print "num".
Otherwise print "NOT num".
If v is a text, print "text".
Otherwise print "NOT text".